y":"I think whatever is generating the code is simply generating an invalid signature, or rather one not accepted by the JVM class verifier. The signature is a piece of data used to establish the generic type of the class (as opposed to the descriptor, which is used to unambiguously identify a class or member). The relevant info can be found in [§4.7.9 of the JVM specification version 17](https://docs.oracle.com/javase/specs/jvms/se17/html/jvms-4.html#jvms-4.7.9).  I believe the expected signature string in this case would be `LLicensedPracticalNurse$Companion;` (note the leading `L` and trailing `;`).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1057239806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dmlloyd","id":124581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDU4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd","html_url":"https://github.com/dmlloyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]